{"ID":"20240118151237-ixuc6ow","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151237-ixuc6ow","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151237-ixuc6ow\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151237-83a11du\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122111747-jjflrih\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122111747-c1aj578\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:302,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:302\u0026#125;","title":"115牛黄","type":"doc","updated":"20240130111048"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151237-83a11du","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151237-83a11du","updated":"20240122111715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦平，主惊痫寒热，热盛狂痓，除邪逐鬼。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111719-ysfh0fq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111719-ysfh0fq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】牛黄生于病牛胆中，状如鸡子黄，多出陕西甘肃等地。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111721-8mpj0pj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111721-8mpj0pj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性平，有小毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111733-qea4fw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111733-qea4fw2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】牛黄为泻热定惊，利痰清心要药，主惊痫，寒热中恶，口噤，小儿惊邪，痘疮发狂，治痰迷，痉急，斑痧疮毒，益肝胆，定魂魄。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111737-ru107ot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111737-ru107ot"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗小儿百病，诸痫热，口不开，大人狂癫，又堕胎，久服令人不忘。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111739-u811dic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111739-u811dic"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】安魂定魄，辟鬼邪，卒中恶，小儿夜啼。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111741-lim3uc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111741-lim3uc1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】主中风失音，口噤，惊悸，天行时疾，健忘虚乏。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111742-mt8jp6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111742-mt8jp6b"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【思邈】益肝胆，定精神，除热，止惊痢，辟恶气，除百病。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111744-zb72kfk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111744-zb72kfk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】化痰定痫，泄热除邪。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111745-7f5prnl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111745-7f5prnl"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通五分至一钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111746-jk0gug8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111746-jk0gug8"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】恶龙骨龙胆（钱乙方中不忌）地黄常山蜚蠊，畏牛膝干漆，风热未深者忌用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111747-ggbe664","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111747-ggbe664"}},{"ID":"20240122111747-c1aj578","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111747-c1aj578","updated":"20240130111048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第115味药，牛黄，大家都知道，有个很有名的药叫牛黄清心丸，那个北平的同仁堂，牛黄清心丸。这个我们经方呢，张仲景是没有用牛黄的。牛黄是怎么来的？是病的牛，牛生病了在胆上产生的那个黄，颜色看见就像鸡蛋黄一样，只有生病了的牛胆上才有那个东西。那能够泄热定惊，牛黄一般来说，清心丸嘛，就能止烦除烦，能让心情比较好。那尤其是过去用到牛黄的地方，南派用在清心这一类寒凉的药，用在这个癫痫，发痫。当年，尤其是小孩子，卖得很多，那只要小孩子喉咙发炎，扁桃发炎，小孩子发那个癫痫，小孩子出疹子，出红疹通通在使用牛黄，对，牛黄。那使用的时候，平常五分到一钱，能到一钱，在这里牛黄这个药你们拿到手上也是直接入生药煎，一般我是不开牛黄丸，臭死了。"}]},{"ID":"20240122111747-jjflrih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111747-jjflrih"}}]}